---------------------------------------------------------------------
PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
23-turn game. Interrupt Addict ran a Primitive Furnace/Single-Shot Rifle self-ping engine (repeatedly destroying own overcosted Reindrix/Relaxaurus at 1500 dmg to reset board) alongside small beaters (Fuack, Reindrix, Foxparks, Jormuntide, Elphidran Aqua, Relaxaurus). Hakurai's Fuack/Reindrix chipped Interrupt Addict early (10->9->8->6) but Interrupt Addict stabilized with Relaxaurus/Chillet blockers and Cryolinx/Reindrix/Blazehowl interrupts on both sides throughout. Interrupt Addict's Relaxaurus (1400) destroyed Hakurai's Relaxaurus (1200) turn 17; Jormuntide chipped Hakurai repeatedly (10->8 turn14 Foxparks, 8->5 turn17, 5->2 turn23) and finished with Reindrix hitting for 2 (2 to 0) same turn.


